  "securityDelta": [
    "Node bearer token is no longer transported over LAN",
    "each protected request uses HMAC-SHA256 with a source-bound single-use nonce",
    "auth bootstrap is challenge-only mode on existing GET /health and returns no normal health metadata",
    "proof binds Node session exact HTTP method/path exact body SHA-256 and all fixed Raven security fields",
    "proof verification happens before action challenge or Node-local approval pair consumption",
    "handoff body is read once cached verified and parsed from identical bytes",
    "requester-source requester-context and Node-local human confirmation remain independent gates",
    "no new capability action or business route authority"
